<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ergo cuts NZ fixed mortgage rates.</title>
<headline>Ergo cuts NZ fixed mortgage rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ergo Personal Financial Services said on Tuesday it was cutting its three-year fixed mortgage lending rate to 8.75 percent from 8.9 percent.</p>
<p>It was cutting its one year rate to 8.9 percent from 9.65 percent and its two year rate to 8.9 percent from 9.5 percent.  </p>
<p>Ergo said it would continue to take rates lower if the market permitted but added that it was unlikely that rates would fall much lower during the coming year.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
